  "goodToKnow": "Die Wartung is maintenance or servicing: die Wartung der Heizung, Wartungsarbeiten (maintenance work), der Wartungsvertrag. It comes from warten in its old sense of to look after, still used technically: eine Maschine warten (to service a machine). For cars, Germans say die Inspektion, and the TÜV checks road safety every two years. Wartungsfrei means maintenance-free. Plural: die Wartungen."
